      "comment": "DOONGALLA EVE (7) is still a maiden after 15 runs but rarely far away, the latest finishing out of the placings when sixth at Shepparton. Tends to run well here despite having never won. Should be very hard to beat this time. FRIDA SCIENCE (4) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (24.11) at Horsham in a Maiden. Can feature with the right run. TORPEDO GIBLET (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 390m behind Paw Zillie (22.87) in a Bottom Up - Maiden. Placed at his previous run. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. PAW PEARL (8) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
